        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your profile, prices, bars, ratings, and everything else you've contributed. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies löscht dein Profil, deine Preise, Bars, Bewertungen und alles andere, was du beigetragen hast, dauerhaft. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime définitivement ton profil, tes prix, tes bars, tes évaluations et toutes tes contributions. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo elimina definitivamente il tuo profilo, i prezzi, i bar, le valutazioni e tutto ciò che hai contribuito. Non è reversibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes all entries for this drink at this bar. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies entfernt alle Einträge für dieses Getränk in dieser Bar. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime toutes les entrées pour cette boisson dans ce bar. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo rimuove tutte le voci per questo drink in questa bar. Non è reversibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the bar and all of its drinks. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
